{"strongs": "H5737", "word": "עָדַר", "translit": "a.dar", "root": "עדן", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "arrange, order", "definition": "I. [ עָדַר ] verb probably (si vera lectio) help (Aramaic loan-word, Syriac ᵑ7 עֲדַר (rare) = Hebrew עזר q. v.; > Thes , assuming meaning arrange, order ); — Qal Infinitive cstr . לַעֲדֹר 1Chr 12:34 ( Baer Ginsb ; van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:33 this meaning also ᵐ5 ᵑ9 ); but < Manuscripts לַעֲוֺר (compare v. 1Chr 12:18 v. 1Chr 12:22 v. 1Chr 12:23 , van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:17 v. 1Chr 12:21 v. 1Chr 12:22 ), so Kau Buhl ; Participle plural construct עֹדְרֵי מַעֲרָכָה v. 1Chr 12:39 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:38 ), read עֹרְכֵי (q. v. v. 1Chr 12:34 ) ᵐ5 Kau ; see ערך .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5836')\">BDB5836</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5737')\">H5737</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5835')\">BDB5835</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5837')\">BDB5837</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>עָדַר</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> probably (si vera lectio) help (Aramaic loan-word, Syriac <placeholder3729/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>עֲדַר</bdbheb> (rare) = Hebrew  <bdbheb><reflink>עזר</reflink></bdbheb> q. v.; &gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup>, assuming meaning <highlight>arrange, order</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Infinitive cstr</highlight>. <bdbheb>לַעֲדֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,34)\">1Chr 12:34</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,33)\">1Chr 12:33</ref> this meaning also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></look